        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Concerned about market volatility? Transform your stock into community impact!</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47291.webp" alt="Concerned about market volatility? Transform your stock into community impact!" loading="lazy">
